. /*===========================================================================
> ==*
> Goal: correct CEPAL surveys with bfmcorr command for cases with tax and wage 
> data and save theta coefficients for analysis and further extrapolations
> Authors: Mauricio De ROSA, Ignacio FLORES, Marc MORGAN
> Date: Feb/2020
> Stage 1: wages
> Stage 2: diverse
> *============================================================================
> =*/
